f the regular season early Sunday morning.","published":"2026-11-22T21:20:00.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50564960/pac-12-reveals-unique-flex-schedule-season-final-week","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Montana State ranked No. 1, 5-7 LIU makes FCS bracket as conference champ","description":"Defending national champion Montana State received the top seed for the 24-team FCS playoffs, while Northeast Conference champion LIU (5-7) became the first playoff team with a losing record since 2017.","published":"2026-11-23T00:02:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50564910/montana-state-grabs-top-seed-24-team-fcs-playoff-bracket","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Wake Forest rewards DC Scottie Hazelton with contract extension","description":"Wake Forest defensive coordinator Scottie Hazelton has signed a contract extension.","published":"2026-11-22T21:20:00.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50564902/wake-forest-rewards-dc-scottie-hazelton-extension","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 college football coaching carousel: Tracking every open job","description":"As the carousel spins, we'll keep you updated with all the comings and goings.","published":"2026-11-22T20:32:48.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50358611/2026-cfb-coaching-carousel-firings-hirings","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who are the candidates and what are the priorities after TCU fired Sonny Dykes?","description":"Things started well for Dykes, but now the Horned Frogs are looking for a new coach and should have options.","published":"2026-11-22T19:55:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50323301/tcu-candidates-personnel-recruits","type":"Story","byline":"Eli Lederman, Max Olson and Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-22T19:15:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"No Big Ten football teams in AP top 5 for first time since 2021","description":"A weekend of Big Ten upsets left the conference without a team in the top five of the AP Top 25 college football poll for the first time since 2021.","published":"2026-11-22T20:22:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50563638/no-big-ten-football-teams-ap-top-5-first-21","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5197086/sahir-west","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sahir_West"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Sahir West","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sahir_West","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:28Z","intro":"Sahir West is an American college football defensive lineman for the UCLA Bruins. He previously played for the James Madison Dukes.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"West attended Mount Saint Joseph High School in Baltimore, Maryland. As a junior, he totaled 63 tackles, ten sacks, and an interception. Following his high school career, West committed to play college football at James Madison University."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"West played sparingly in 2024, appearing in two games and earning a redshirt. His production increased the following season, recording ten tackles, 5.5 tackles for loss, and three sacks in the 2025 Sun Belt Conference Football Championship Game against Troy. At the conclusion of the regular season, West was named the Sun Belt Freshman of the Year and a first-team Freshman All-American by The Athletic."}]}}